\in N\\,:\\,4<x<51},\n$$\n\nor, writing $x\\in Z$ as before, we have\n\n$$\nS={x\\in Z\\,:\\,4<x<51}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186198844 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186198464 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "9df722a8-2db6-5bb8-a69c-b81b33037ab2" :knowledge-point/title "Expressing a Given Set Using a Geometric Sequence"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ab9b0b3f-b15e-5055-8391-6a00a8a6ab80" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3} \\cdot 2^{n}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186196106} {:answer/id #uuid "cbfa0d86-cf70-5f60-9429-04161e6de2e6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3} \\cdot 3^{n}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186196107} {:answer/id #uuid "efe290b7-6353-5af9-b4bf-685865ed0034" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2} \\cdot 3^{n}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186196108} {:answer/id #uuid "2c33a4ce-b38e-5507-b4b4-59c57b0f378d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3 \\cdot 2^{n}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186196109} {:answer/id #uuid "6547d7f2-2d9b-5294-8559-a3673ef200d8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2^{n}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186196110}] :answer-field/id #uuid "df590f96-bdbc-5cea-924f-b7889883e3c2" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186196105} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6756d5e9-8c2b-5648-9cef-d57cf02e8e50" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot {2}^{n}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396245} {:answer/id #uuid "de50addf-3149-5f58-b066-97f2f40179d2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\cdot {2}^{n}" :db/id #